Browserslist: browsers data (caniuse-lite) is 7 months old. Please run:
  npx update-browserslist-db@latest
  Why you should do it regularly: https://github.com/browserslist/update-db#readme


  Native Git branch picker
    ✔ shows one checkout choice for a tracking branch, retaining its different remote tip
    ✔ does not collapse unrelated local and remote branches just because their commit is identical

  Git editor save barrier
    ✔ waits for buffered operations before invoking Git and always restores editor access
    ✔ does not run Git if saving timed out or buffered edits remain

  Paper Assistant /git commands
    ✔ documents every supported command and per-command parameters
    ✔ parses quoted arguments and flags without shell expansion
    ✔ fills pull defaults and freezes undo fingerprint
    ✔ rejects invalid parameters before mutation

  Native blame presentation
    ✔ preserves indentation, empty source lines, final line numbers and native commit identity
    ✔ supports SHA-256 Git object names without treating source lines as metadata
    ✔ navigates to the exact full commit hash from a displayed line (123ms)
